(
    title: "Alcazar: The Forgotten Fortress",
    developer: Some("Tom Loughry"),
    description: Some("Cross a countryside of castles to reach Alcazar, the greatest of them, and sit on its throne. Each castle is a maze of rooms seen from above, guarded by demons that each need the right defence — bullets, oil, raw meat — so you gather tools and weapons as you go. A rope or raft opens shortcuts across lakes and broken bridges, and the map changes every game."),
